{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達周一宣佈恢復黃仁勳行政總裁職務。過去數日，美國政府公開表態持續力挺這位 CEO，特朗普對此表示祝賀。英偉達官宣消息發佈數分鐘後，特朗普在真實社交平台發帖稱：「英偉達董事會做出了正確且恰當的決定。美國政府沒有理由認為黃仁勳重返英偉達會帶來任何國家安全風險。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587700.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.045216+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:22:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_hash":"aea3262e48dcca75a04b3e6bb16c9baf10596adbac295e14581455bba5c40262","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}